data: {"level":2,"reviewed":{"level":2,"label":"formula / approach","text":"The ratio of binomial coefficients telescopes into a product of `k` factors. Each factor is\n`1 - c / (n - i)` for `i` from `0` to `k - 1`. Do not evaluate the coefficients themselves. When\nthe answer is tiny, `1 - product` cancels, so combine the factors as a sum of logarithms and use\n`log1p` for each term and `expm1` at the end."},"hints_note":null}

